From: mscharged-port contributors
Subject: [PATCH] Preserve retained GX co-planar depth setup
Upstream-base: d664382f57002fbff143911c81b06b7e7a4b3ab4
Classification: native GX rasterization hardware contract.

Consume the actual depth-freeze bit and retain last selected polygon depth
coefficients by value for queued consumers, including CULL_ALL and finite
positive-W side-offscreen setup. Preserve coverage, transforms, render
requests and GX ABI. Unsupported setup errors rather than inventing a plane.
Apply after 0066; vertex position invariance remains intact.

